claim.claim-text:
a first instruction unit configured to perform a switching instruction to switch software mounted on a plurality of on-board devices;
an acquisition unit configured to acquire version information of the software that has been switched of the on-board devices responding to the switching instruction;
a confirmation unit configured to confirm whether versions of the software mounted on the on-board devices have consistency, based on the version information acquired by the acquisition unit; and
a second instruction unit configured to instruct the on-board devices to restore the switched software to the software previous to switching, based on a confirmation that the versions of the software mounted on the on-board devices do not have the consistency.

performing a switching instruction to switch software mounted on a plurality of on-board devices;
